  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6B1113DA0000003E}" {
   m_sTitle "Roadbook"
   m_sTextData "Switchback - 15.4 km, point to point, start and finish on the Elektrozavodsk breakwater."\
   ""\
   "CO-DRIVER: at each checkpoint a hint gives you the calls for the road ahead. Every pace note is also on your map, numbered, as an orange dot at its corner. Read the next corners out early; the driver doesn't get them on screen."\
   ""\
   "Grades: 1 is the tightest corner, 6 the fastest; flat is flat out. Square: a 90 degree junction. Distances in metres to the next call; into and and mean it follows straight on."\
   ""\
